  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p><strong>Minor Physical Mutation</strong></p>\n<p>You move like a combination of a predator and a dancer, your body a serpentine whirl o motion on the battlefield as you move among your opponents. You gain +5 WS, +10 Agility and the @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.NDetl9BhAQBVnHKf]{Combat Master} and @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.SgjJMBgc85aswvhm]{Relentless} Talents. Your unnatural grace makes it hard for you to blend in with a crowd. You get a -10 modifier                 when trying to use Stealth to blend in among people.</p>"
    },
